					"usage": "Strands",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 6
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Strands (16): Most encounters with a roper begin when it fires strong, sticky strands. The creature can have up to six strands at once, and they can strike up to 20 yards away. This is a ranged attack that has Acc 3, Recoil 1, and uses the Innate Attack (Projectile) skill. The roper can vary this attack’s RoF from 1 to 6. If one or multiple strands were severed or released, the roper can replenish the lost uses by taking three Ready maneuvers (they do not have to be consecutive)."
				}
			]
		}
